        "source_field_name.title": "Source Field  Name",
        "summary": "<xdoc><p>Transforms fields in a table or feature class based on schema defined in the definition table and creates a new table or feature class.</p><p>You can do the following using this tool:<ul><li>Add new fields.</li><li>Update existing fields.</li><li>Reorder fields.</li><li>Change field types.</li><li>Change field properties.</li><li>Assign or update field aliases.</li><li>Calculate field values based on existing fields using Python.</li><li>Remove fields.</li></ul></p></xdoc>",
